s/12mIfaiDWfLcHIzzic_UefunrF3Chg0pZ?usp=sharing\n\nYou can change the details of the clothes or any other points that are unclear as you like, and if you have difficulty in drawing, I am happy to make an original costume for you!\nWe do not have any size specifications, so please feel free to draw them as you like.\nIf you would like to draw it, we would appreciate it if you would allow us to share it with your followers or use it as wallpaper for personal use.\n\nThank you for reading this far. I look forward to continuing to secretly enjoy your work!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/12mIfaiDWfLcHIzzic_UefunrF3Chg0pZ?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@ojoj_15ji/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2e8811ea/uploads/origins/cf87e928-fa24-48ad-afc0-c462481b2258?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a779538ad1a5cbf82d37a6b378b31b65", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2e8811ea/uploads/origins/cf87e928-fa24-48ad-afc0-c462481b2258?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a779538ad1a5cbf82d37a6b378b31b65, https://si.imgix.net/2e8811ea/uploads/origins/cf87e928-fa24-48ad-afc0-c462481b2258?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=72cd3baed036e2e70d0c58c700d77b18 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2e8811ea/uploads/origins/cf87e928-fa24-48ad-afc0-c462481b2258?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=60f18cf9c07a6c3c802117ebe0398137 3x"}, "private": true, "genre"